{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"当前最值得解释的不是感受变强，而是它在很轻的维持中重新获得了可表达的形状：右手的主题像从已经持续着的东西里自然显出来；之后即使一度增密、增强，再收回，也仍像同一份体验内部的起伏，而不是一次新的启动。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H1：这次体验从一开始就已经明确在场；即使外露强度很快收敛，内在的持续并未中断。\",\"bridge\":\"因为此前已经建立了“外露收敛并不等于内在中断”，所以m.4-5表层暂时只剩低强度的连续维持时，不必理解成感受消失。这样m.6出现的可歌唱线条就更像原本持续着的体验取得了清晰表达，而非被某件新事重新触发。\",\"current\":\"因此这一段可以同时容纳克制、清晰表达、短暂涌起和再次减弱：变化发生在表达强度和形态上，体验本身的连续性没有因此被重置。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H1，m.6很容易被理解成一次新的情绪出现，后面的增强也会更像重新发动；有了H1，这里更具体地成为“持续中的东西开始显形并发生起伏”。\"},\"used\":[\"H1\"],\"new_history\":[\"H2：这份体验可以在外露近乎退到只剩安静维持后，不经重新启动就重新获得清晰表达；随后一次明显的增强与收回也没有破坏它的连续感。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"H1实际改变了对m.6进入性质的理解：不是单纯‘更投入’，而是区分了重新出现与未中断后的显形。没有把力度增长当作外部回应或关系变化；新增H2只记录本段真正建立的连续性形态。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "11b833d1-5517-4def-942f-78f4e7d887cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214219264655Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.219, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:42:43.481328+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d4bd7cc9b451bb4b72183dc66b1d03e6486ca51ade23f7c50ba530d9b1611b93", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214219264655Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1278cfe79b3a3f697f2057a825cc16b3869f74cc33fc9e96fde045124d5d9a9b"}}}
